('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011','20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','WH-A1','Role context — incumbent','sme_interview','Coordinate a safe outbound shift. Reports to operations manager; leads 12 associates. Contacts inventory, transport and safety teams. Evening shift; on-site warehouse.','Morgan Lee (fictional)'),
